From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Prithwiraj Samanta <app@datainsights.ae>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 17:26:47 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] telecode: convert between HTML pages and canvas layers

telecode_import_html builds a web page as editable layers in a new frame,
in one mutation and one undo step. With `snapshot` it takes the layout
TeleDesign measured in headless Edge after the page's scripts ran (painted
boxes with fills, gradients, borders, radii and shadows; text runs with
their font and wrap width; images as image fills; inline SVG through
import_svg), which is what a React/Babel page needs: its markup alone is
empty. With `html` (+ `css`) it runs @open-pencil/dom-css's browser importer
on static markup and copies the result under a frame.

telecode_export_html projects a frame through dom-css and returns its
standalone HTML export (absolute layout, inline styles, inlined images).
